# FlowTree — Colunas do board — módulo `tasks`

@host = http://localhost:5100/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
@projectUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DO_PROJETO
@columnUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DA_COLUNA

### Listar colunas (com cards_count)
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/columns
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar coluna (entra no fim)
POST {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/columns
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Em revisão",
  "color": "#4a6d63",
  "wip_limit": 3,
  "is_done": false
}

### Atualizar coluna (nome, cor, WIP, is_done)
PUT {{host}}/columns/{{columnUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Em revisão de código",
  "color": "#5c7b5d",
  "wip_limit": 5
}

### Remover o limite de WIP
PUT {{host}}/columns/{{columnUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "wip_limit": null
}

### Reordenar colunas (posições 0..n na ordem enviada)
PATCH {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/columns/reorder
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "column_uuids": [
    "UUID_COLUNA_1",
    "UUID_COLUNA_2",
    "UUID_COLUNA_3"
  ]
}

### Excluir coluna (exclui os cards junto; última coluna → 422)
DELETE {{host}}/columns/{{columnUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
